  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "- Architecture Shift: Replaced the resource-heavy \"1-Session-1-Channel-1-Task\" model with a highly efficient Worker-based processing engine.\n      - Throughput Breakthrough: Achieved 100x improvement in network throughput by consolidating packet processing into high-performance worker pools.\n      - Zero-Allocation: Full transition to span-based, zero-allocation API to eliminate GC pressure in the hot path.\n      - Concurrency: Dramatically reduced CPU context switching, allowing the engine to handle massive request volumes with minimal resource footprint.\n      - Performance: Optimized core pipeline for near-hardware-limit network saturation.",
